so good evening  today we add an important chapter in our  fight against covet 19.  we took the decision to make available  for european citizens  the first covet 19 vaccine  we granted conditional market  authorization to the vaccine  produced by biontech and pfizer  the european medicine agency assessed  this vaccine thoroughly  and it concluded that it is safe and  effective against  covet 19. based on this scientific  assessment we proceeded to authorize it  for the european union market  as we have promised this vaccine will be  available for all  eu countries at the same time  on the same conditions the first batches  of this vaccine  will be shipped from pfizer's  manufacturing site  here in belgium within the next days  and i've always said during this  pandemic  that we are in this together  so vaccination can start at the same  time  during the european union vaccination  days  on december 27th 28th and 29th  this is a very good way to end this  difficult  year and to finally start turning the  page  on covet 19. this  is our first vaccine more will be  approved soon  if they prove to be safe and effective  emma will issue its opinion on the  second  vaccine that of moderna on the 6th  of january and while we deliver vaccines  for europeans  we also help secure them for the rest of  the world  team europe is the largest contributor  to the covex facility with over  million euros for producing vaccines for  the low and middle income countries  and finally allow me to say how  proud i am that the first covet vex  covered 19 vaccine available in europe  is a true product of european innovation  so biontech has received more than 9  million euros  of eu research funding over the past  decade  to develop these really ground breaking  technologies  and it secured a 100 million euro  loan from the european investment bank  that is backed  by the european union in june  this helped expand its manufacturing  capacities and supply  the vaccine quickly worldwide and  this is a true european success story  so thank you so much  you
 

